{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_town003_kanban_01",
      "hash": "2bbe41186cad3f48",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是深灰市\\n深灰即是堅若磐石的灰黑之色"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_town003_kanban_02",
      "hash": "2bbe44186cad4461",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "深灰科學博物館"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_town003_kanban_03",
      "hash": "2bbe43186cad42ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "深灰市寶可夢道館\\n館主小剛\\r\\n如岩石般強大的男人"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_town003_kanban_04",
      "hash": "2bbe46186cad47c7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……有用的告示板！\\c\\n同行的寶可夢即使沒有\\n參與戰鬥也能獲得經驗值！\\c\\n另外，只要在戰鬥中稍微露個面，\\n牠們就能獲得更多的經驗值！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_town003_kanban_05",
      "hash": "2bbe45186cad4614",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……這裡貼了張告示！\\c\\n最近，有一班惡徒在月見山\\n恣意偷取珍貴的寶可夢化石！\\r\\n如發現可疑的人物……！\\r\\n……請通知深灰市警察。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_town003_youngf_01",
      "hash": "90a189b82a33e733",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳知道這個傳聞嗎？\\n聽說皮皮是從月亮來的。\\c\\n自從月之石掉到月見山後，\\n人們才開始看見牠們的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_town003_youngm_01_01",
      "hash": "981eaa86b8cb8766",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "深灰市盡是些\\n像捕蟲少年一樣\\r\\n只把寶可夢當成\\r\\n一種興趣來玩的傢伙！\\c\\n但是，深灰道館的\\n小剛可不一樣！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_town003_youngm_02_01",
      "hash": "f1536aa0001cadd9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳參觀過博物館了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_town003_youngm_02_02",
      "hash": "f15367a0001ca8c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那些在月見山發現的\\n化石展示品實在是太棒了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_town003_youngm_02_03",
      "hash": "f15368a0001caa73",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不會吧……！\\n那[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一定要去看看啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_town003_youngm_02_04",
      "hash": "f1536da0001cb2f2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_town003_clerkm_01",
      "hash": "52b2a5aed164d899",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咻～！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳知道\\r\\n我在幹什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_town003_clerkm_02",
      "hash": "52b2a2aed164d380",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對……就是那個！\\n這比想像中費勁啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_town003_clerkm_03",
      "hash": "52b2a3aed164d533",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為了防止野生寶可夢\\n進到花壇裡面，\\r\\n我在噴除蟲噴霧啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_town003_clerkf_01",
      "hash": "1a53b55015e7308e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咻～！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳知道我在做什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_town003_clerkf_02",
      "hash": "1a53b45015e72edb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對……沒錯！\\n這比想像中費勁呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_town003_clerkf_03",
      "hash": "1a53b35015e72d28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為了讓野生寶可夢\\n接近花壇，\\r\\n我在噴引蟲香水呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_town003_poke_02",
      "hash": "811d3b41f5a144bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "綠毛蟲「毛蟲～"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_town003_childf_01",
      "hash": "575e6ce7733024fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這是我的小蝶！\\c\\n和牠走在一起的時候，\\n牠偶爾會幫我找到一些道具呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_town003_poke_01",
      "hash": "811d3c41f5a1466e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小蝶「大蝶～"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_town003_fat_01",
      "hash": "314115bad6fa6d26",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊～真涼快～\\c\\n深灰市位於岩山山腳，\\n所以這裡挺涼爽的呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_town003_poke_03",
      "hash": "811d3a41f5a14308",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小拳石「轟隆轟隆……"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_town003_middlef_01",
      "hash": "3c094088a2ecfe84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要好好珍惜\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的零用錢喔。\\c\\n不過，偶爾大量採購一下精靈球\\n也是件挺快樂的事呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_town003_childm_01",
      "hash": "c87a5c8d9fb0f192",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇……真好啊！\\n寶可夢騎在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳身上呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_town003_shortpants_01",
      "hash": "7cb050fa1f22742d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 24]"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_town003_shortpants_02",
      "hash": "7cb04dfa1f226f14",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 25]"
    }
  ],
